Exercise 5.4.What is the output of the following program? Draw a stack diagram that shows the
state of the program when it prints the result.
def  recurse(n,  s):
      if  n  ==  0:
             print(s)
      else:
             recurse(n-1,  n+s)

recurse(3,  0)

